we'd like to replace and have a continuous program of replacement where we're replacing

514
00:40:36,361 --> 00:40:38,780
these sections with galvanized open grading.

515
00:40:42,380 --> 00:40:48,780
In 1996, the Bridge Authority appropriated over $70 million to paint the five-mile structure.

516
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:53,209
What has happened is we have so many coatings of paint on the bridge.

517
00:40:53,210 --> 00:40:54,000
It's like the old

518
